### 1. Criar autorização Open Finance
POST http://localhost:3333/openfinance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "expirationDate": "2026-05-27",
  "authorization": true
}

### 2. Atualizar autorização (action=update)
PATCH http://localhost:3333/openfinance/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "expirationDate": "2026-05-01",
  "authorization": true
}

### 3. Revogar autorização (action=revoke)
PATCH http://localhost:3333/openfinance/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cpf": "12345678901"
}

### 4. Consultar saldo
GET http://localhost:3333/openfinance?account=12345-6&agency=0001

### 5. Criar transação
POST http://localhost:3333/openfinance/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "account": "12345-6",
  "agency": "0001",
  "amount": 343.46
}